{"said":"aura-2-hyperion-en\nIf you want a local language model or embeddings in Java, there are options. They work, though they're often slower than they should be. [pause] But what if you want to isolate the vocals from a track? Generate product shots for a catalogue? Turn a storyboard into footage? Or any of a plethora of other capabilities? [pause] From the JVM, you're stuck. It's a Python stack, or a tool like Comfy U.I. behind HTTP: another runtime, another process, and a network hop on every call. Kiln calls the native engines directly. No Python, no server, nothing in between.","words":[{"word":"if","start":0.32,"end":0.56},{"word":"you","start":0.56,"end":0.71999997},{"word":"want","start":0.71999997,"end":0.88},{"word":"a","start":0.88,"end":0.96},{"word":"local","start":0.96,"end":1.28},{"word":"language","start":1.28,"end":1.5999999},{"word":"model","start":1.5999999,"end":2.24},{"word":"or","start":2.24,"end":2.9599998},{"word":"embeddings","start":3.36,"end":4.16},{"word":"in","start":4.3199997,"end":4.64},{"word":"java","start":4.64,"end":5.44},{"word":"there","start":5.52,"end":5.7599998},{"word":"are","start":5.7599998,"end":5.92},{"word":"options","start":5.92,"end":6.64},{"word":"they","start":6.96,"end":7.2},{"word":"work","start":7.2,"end":7.84},{"word":"though","start":8.08,"end":8.32},{"word":"they're","start":8.32,"end":8.639999},{"word":"often","start":8.639999,"end":8.96},{"word":"slower","start":8.96,"end":9.28},{"word":"than","start":9.28,"end":9.5199995},{"word":"they","start":9.5199995,"end":9.679999},{"word":"should","start":9.679999,"end":9.92},{"word":"be","start":9.92,"end":10.4},{"word":"but","start":11.2,"end":11.44},{"word":"what","start":11.44,"end":11.599999},{"word":"if","start":11.599999,"end":11.759999},{"word":"you","start":11.759999,"end":11.84},{"word":"want","start":11.84,"end":12},{"word":"to","start":12,"end":12.16},{"word":"isolate","start":12.16,"end":12.559999},{"word":"the","start":12.559999,"end":12.719999},{"word